{"page":19,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:120","surah":2,"ayah":120,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَن تَرْضَىٰ عَنكَ ٱلْيَهُودُ وَلَا ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ حَتَّىٰ تَتَّبِعَ مِلَّتَهُمْ ۗ قُلْ إِنَّ هُدَى ٱللَّهِ هُوَ ٱلْهُدَىٰ ۗ وَلَئِنِ ٱتَّبَعْتَ أَهْوَآءَهُم بَعْدَ ٱلَّذِى جَآءَكَ مِنَ ٱلْعِلْمِ ۙ مَا لَكَ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ مِن وَلِىٍّ وَلَا نَصِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Jews and the Christians will never be pleased with you unless you follow their ways. Say, ‘God’s guidance is the only true guidance.’ If you were to follow their desires after the knowledge that has come to you, you would find no one to protect you from God or help you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَن","en_gloss":"And never","transliteration":"walan","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرْضَىٰ","en_gloss":"will be pleased","transliteration":"tarḍā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَنكَ","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"ʿanka","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْيَهُودُ","en_gloss":"the Jews","transliteration":"l-yahūdu","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and [not]","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","en_gloss":"the Christians","transliteration":"l-naṣārā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَتَّبِعَ","en_gloss":"you follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿa","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِلَّتَهُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"their religion","transliteration":"millatahum","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":12,"ar":"هُدَى","en_gloss":"(the) Guidance","transliteration":"hudā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ ۗ","en_gloss":"(is) the Guidance","transliteration":"l-hudā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَئِنِ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wala-ini","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱتَّبَعْتَ","en_gloss":"you follow","transliteration":"ittabaʿta","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَهْوَآءَهُم","en_gloss":"their desires","transliteration":"ahwāahum","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":19,"ar":"بَعْدَ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿda","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":21,"ar":"جَآءَكَ","en_gloss":"has come to you","transliteration":"jāaka","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":22,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمِ ۙ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'mi","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":25,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":26,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":28,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَلِىٍّۢ","en_gloss":"protector","transliteration":"waliyyin","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":30,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":31,"ar":"نَصِيرٍ","en_gloss":"any helper","transliteration":"naṣīrin","verse_key":"2:120"},{"pos":32,"ar":"١٢٠","en_gloss":"(120)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:120"}]},{"verse_key":"2:121","surah":2,"ayah":121,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ يَتْلُونَهُۥ حَقَّ تِلَاوَتِهِۦٓ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ يُؤْمِنُونَ بِهِۦ ۗ وَمَن يَكْفُرْ بِهِۦ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those to whom We have given the Scripture, who follow it as it deserves, are the ones who truly believe in it. Those who deny its truth will be the losers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"We have given them","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَتْلُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"recite it","transliteration":"yatlūnahu","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَقَّ","en_gloss":"(as it has the) right","transliteration":"ḥaqqa","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تِلَاوَتِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"(of) its recitation","transliteration":"tilāwatihi","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those (people)","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَكْفُرْ","en_gloss":"disbelieves","transliteration":"yakfur","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the losers","transliteration":"l-khāsirūna","verse_key":"2:121"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٢١","en_gloss":"(121)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:121"}]},{"verse_key":"2:122","surah":2,"ayah":122,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱذْكُرُوا۟ نِعْمَتِىَ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَنْعَمْتُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَأَنِّى فَضَّلْتُكُمْ عَلَى ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Children of Israel, remember how I blessed you and favoured you over other people,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(of) Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"Remember","transliteration":"udh'kurū","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نِعْمَتِىَ","en_gloss":"My Favor","transliteration":"niʿ'matiya","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنْعَمْتُ","en_gloss":"I bestowed","transliteration":"anʿamtu","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنِّى","en_gloss":"and that I","transliteration":"wa-annī","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَضَّلْتُكُمْ","en_gloss":"[I] preferred you","transliteration":"faḍḍaltukum","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"the worlds","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","verse_key":"2:122"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٢٢","en_gloss":"(122)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:122"}]},{"verse_key":"2:123","surah":2,"ayah":123,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟ يَوْمًا لَّا تَجْزِى نَفْسٌ عَن نَّفْسٍ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا يُقْبَلُ مِنْهَا عَدْلٌ وَلَا تَنفَعُهَا شَفَـٰعَةٌ وَلَا هُمْ يُنصَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and beware of a Day when no soul can stand in for another. No compensation will be accepted from it, nor intercession be of use to it, nor will anyone be helped.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fear","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a day","transliteration":"yawman","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَجْزِى","en_gloss":"will avail","transliteration":"tajzī","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَفْسٌ","en_gloss":"a soul","transliteration":"nafsun","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"(of)","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَّفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"(another) soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُقْبَلُ","en_gloss":"will be accepted","transliteration":"yuq'balu","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَدْلٌۭ","en_gloss":"any compensation","transliteration":"ʿadlun","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَنفَعُهَا","en_gloss":"will benefit it","transliteration":"tanfaʿuhā","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَفَـٰعَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"any intercession","transliteration":"shafāʿatun","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":17,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يُنصَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be helped","transliteration":"yunṣarūna","verse_key":"2:123"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٢٣","en_gloss":"(123)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:123"}]},{"verse_key":"2:124","surah":2,"ayah":124,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذِ ٱبْتَلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ رَبُّهُۥ بِكَلِمَـٰتٍ فَأَتَمَّهُنَّ ۖ قَالَ إِنِّى جَاعِلُكَ لِلنَّاسِ إِمَامًا ۖ قَالَ وَمِن ذُرِّيَّتِى ۖ قَالَ لَا يَنَالُ عَهْدِى ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When Abraham’s Lord tested him with certain commandments, which he fulfilled, He said, ‘I will make you a leader of people.’ Abraham asked, ‘And will You make leaders from my descendants too?’ God answered, ‘My pledge does not hold for those who do evil.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِذِ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhi","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱبْتَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"tried","transliteration":"ib'talā","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbuhu","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِكَلِمَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"with words","transliteration":"bikalimātin","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَأَتَمَّهُنَّ ۖ","en_gloss":"and he fulfilled them","transliteration":"fa-atammahunna","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَاعِلُكَ","en_gloss":"(am) the One to make you","transliteration":"jāʿiluka","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for the mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِمَامًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"a leader","transliteration":"imāman","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمِن","en_gloss":"And from","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّتِى ۖ","en_gloss":"my offspring","transliteration":"dhurriyyatī","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":15,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَنَالُ","en_gloss":"reach","transliteration":"yanālu","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَهْدِى","en_gloss":"My Covenant","transliteration":"ʿahdī","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"(to) the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"2:124"},{"pos":20,"ar":"١٢٤","en_gloss":"(124)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:124"}]},{"verse_key":"2:125","surah":2,"ayah":125,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ جَعَلْنَا ٱلْبَيْتَ مَثَابَةً لِّلنَّاسِ وَأَمْنًا وَٱتَّخِذُوا۟ مِن مَّقَامِ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ مُصَلًّى ۖ وَعَهِدْنَآ إِلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ أَن طَهِّرَا بَيْتِىَ لِلطَّآئِفِينَ وَٱلْعَـٰكِفِينَ وَٱلرُّكَّعِ ٱلسُّجُودِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We made the House a resort and a sanctuary for people, saying, ‘Take the spot where Abraham stood as your place of prayer.’ We commanded Abraham and Ishmael: ‘Purify My House for those who walk round it, those who stay there, and those who bow and prostrate themselves in worship.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْبَيْتَ","en_gloss":"the House","transliteration":"l-bayta","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَثَابَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a place of return","transliteration":"mathābatan","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَمْنًۭا","en_gloss":"and (a place of) security","transliteration":"wa-amnan","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱتَّخِذُوا۟","en_gloss":"and (said), \"Take","transliteration":"wa-ittakhidhū","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّقَامِ","en_gloss":"(the) standing place","transliteration":"maqāmi","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُصَلًّۭى ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) a place of prayer","transliteration":"muṣallan","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَعَهِدْنَآ","en_gloss":"And We made a covenant","transliteration":"waʿahid'nā","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","en_gloss":"and Ishmael","transliteration":"wa-is'māʿīla","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":17,"ar":"طَهِّرَا","en_gloss":"[You both] purify","transliteration":"ṭahhirā","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بَيْتِىَ","en_gloss":"My House","transliteration":"baytiya","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لِلطَّآئِفِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who circumambulate","transliteration":"lilṭṭāifīna","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَٱلْعَـٰكِفِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who seclude themselves for devotion and prayer","transliteration":"wal-ʿākifīna","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَٱلرُّكَّعِ","en_gloss":"and those who bow down","transliteration":"wal-rukaʿi","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱلسُّجُودِ","en_gloss":"and those who prostrate","transliteration":"l-sujūdi","verse_key":"2:125"},{"pos":23,"ar":"١٢٥","en_gloss":"(125)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:125"}]},{"verse_key":"2:126","surah":2,"ayah":126,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ قَالَ إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ رَبِّ ٱجْعَلْ هَـٰذَا بَلَدًا ءَامِنًا وَٱرْزُقْ أَهْلَهُۥ مِنَ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ مَنْ ءَامَنَ مِنْهُم بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ ۖ قَالَ وَمَن كَفَرَ فَأُمَتِّعُهُۥ قَلِيلًا ثُمَّ أَضْطَرُّهُۥٓ إِلَىٰ عَذَابِ ٱلنَّارِ ۖ وَبِئْسَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Abraham said, ‘My Lord, make this land secure and provide with produce those of its people who believe in God and the Last Day.’ God said, ‘As for those who disbelieve, I will grant them enjoyment for a short while and then subject them to the torment of the Fire- an evil destination.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"2:126"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"2:126"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِـۧمُ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīmu","verse_key":"2:126"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"2:126"},{"po